age=task('P1-19-AGE-MODEL','model','Watch permission, a consistent completed-years age question, two replies and accurate letter-labelled records.','Mrs Binta asks permission and then asks each fictional role: How old are you in completed years? D replies 5 years and E replies 8 years; she records D=5, E=8 in labelled person-letter/age-in-years rows and checks each reply. Letters identify different fictional people, not age values or rank. A declined interview is replaced by a consenting adult role-playing a different fictional person. Reading this finished table is not interview performance.',O[:1])
