 tx('She labels a BLANK strip D. Its bottom meets the floor line. She looks squarely and marks the strip level with the top of D\'s head. She repeats for E using the same upright method. She aligns strip bottoms, compares the marks, then writes the result.',285,13),
 height(['D','E'],[390,435],555),
