guided=task('P1-19-GUIDED','guided','With support conduct two new fictional interviews and mark/compare/record two new full-size stand-ins; interpret the guided diagram separately.','Supported age collection: ask permission and the identical completed-years question to two new adult fictional roles F and G, obtain replies only after asking, record labelled ages accurately and check back. Height: label two blank strips F/G, align bottom to each stand-in floor line, mark observed head tops, align bottoms, compare and record actual results. Fixed guided diagram F shorter than G, G taller than F is only interpretation, not evidence of new collection. Actual ages and heights are conditional; accept accurate different results and record support.')
